\section{Code Availability}

All code is implemented in NumPy and runs on CPU. No GPU is required.

Repository: \url{https://github.com/MenteE-s/adaptive-cognitive-processing}

Files:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \texttt{acp\_model.py}: core architecture with fast, deliberate, and monitor pathways
